      "citation": "Murray (1926) Proc. Natl. Acad. Sci. USA 12(3):207-214",
      "doi": "10.1073/pnas.12.3.207",
      "role": "Minimum-work vascular cube law r_0^3 = r_1^3 + r_2^3 arising in Hagen-Poiseuille tubes (D_ij propto r_ij^4) at equilibrium Q_ij propto D_ij^(3/4) <=> gamma = 4/3"
    },
    {
      "citation": "Bonifaci, Mehlhorn & Varma (2012) J. Theor. Biol. 309:121-133",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jtbi.2012.06.017",
      "role": "Lyapunov convergence proof that the Physarum dynamics dD_ij/dt = |Q_ij| - D_ij globally converges to the shortest source-sink path on general graphs"
    }
